{"id":"369c9ce912d7ccb6","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-canonical-bundle.md","title":"Canonical Bundle","display":"df-canonical-bundle — Canonical Bundle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-canonical-bundle","aliases":["58-df-canonical-bundle","Canonical Bundle"],"display":"df-canonical-bundle — Canonical Bundle","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-canonical-bundle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-canonical-bundle</span><span>Canonical Bundle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-canonical-bundle — Canonical Bundle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"eaa26a086cb6c5af\" href=\"?note=eaa26a086cb6c5af\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md\">../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega,\\Omega,p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,n\\in V\">\\(\\omega,\\Omega,p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,n\\in V\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 是外部已选定的 top-cotangent line-bundle data code</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\">\\(\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\)</span>（六参数线丛谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eaa26a086cb6c5af\" href=\"?note=eaa26a086cb6c5af\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md\">../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CanonicalBundleData}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CanonicalBundleData}_S\\)</span>（本文件定义的相对编码桥）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}bundle} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalBundleData}_S(\\omega,\\Omega;p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\n\\Omega=\\langle p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,n\\rangle\\land\\omega=\\Omega\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}bundle} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalBundleData}_S(\\omega,\\Omega;p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\n\\Omega=\\langle p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,n\\rangle\\land\\omega=\\Omega\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Canonical bundle is the determinant of the cotangent bundle. The current knowledge base has no algebraic cotangent-bundle/exterior-power constructor, so this atom only validates and aliases an explicitly supplied top-cotangent line-bundle code.</li>\n<li>本文件不再声称从未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega^1_{X/k}\">\\(\\Omega^1_{X/k}\\)</span> 构造线丛，也不再用错误的二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S\\)</span> 或无来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_X(K_X)\">\\(\\mathcal O_X(K_X)\\)</span> 同构。</li>\n<li>Kodaira dimension: growth rate of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h^0(X, K_X^{\\otimes m})\">\\(h^0(X, K_X^{\\otimes m})\\)</span> as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m \\to \\infty\">\\(m \\to \\infty\\)</span></li>\n<li>Minimal model program: birational classification via canonical singularities</li>\n<li>Canonical form: in symplectic geometry, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\omega = \\emptyset\">\\(K_\\omega = \\emptyset\\)</span>; contact analogue</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>Beauville, Complex Algebraic Surfaces</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"eaa26a086cb6c5af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"eaa26a086cb6c5af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)$（六参数线丛谓词，see [[../batch03/58-df-line-bundle.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\omega,\\Omega,p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CanonicalBundleData}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}bundle} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CanonicalBundleData}_S(\\omega,\\Omega;p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(n\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k)\\land\n\\Omega=\\langle p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,n\\rangle\\land\\omega=\\Omega\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega^1_{X/k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LineBundle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_X(K_X)","display":false},{"tex":"h^0(X, K_X^{\\otimes m})","display":false},{"tex":"m \\to \\infty","display":false},{"tex":"K_\\omega = \\emptyset","display":false}],"bytes":1693,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c6d7cb9d5ebdb5c","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega_X$ (canonical bundle of $X$, see [[../batch02/58-df-canonical-bundle.md]])"},{"id":"03dcbc472c7a5883","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K_X$ (canonical divisor, see [[../batch02/58-df-canonical-bundle.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-227","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-canonical-bundle.md|58-df-canonical-bundle]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["eaa26a086cb6c5af"]}